{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2021-06-17 06:55:00', 'title': 'DUPONT ANNOUNCES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL., JUNE 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUPONT (NYSE: DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A THIRD QUARTER DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE ON THE OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY (PAR VALUE $0.01 PER SHARE) PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 15, 2021, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD OF SAID STOCK AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JULY 30, 2021.'}